[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
SwallowTail has been installed at:

  %%SWALLOWTAIL_ROOT%%

This port contains all SwallowTail service integrations. Enable and start the
services you want on this host:

  sysrc swallowtail_subsystem_enable=YES
  sysrc swallowtail_storage_enable=YES
  service swallowtail_subsystem start
  service swallowtail_storage start

Service defaults are embedded in the rc.d scripts. Override them in
/etc/rc.conf using swallowtail_subsystem_* and swallowtail_storage_* variables.
EOM
}
]
